---
import Layout from '@layouts/layout.astro'
---

<Layout title="Alejandro Asensio">
  <main class="flex flex-col gap-8">
    <h1 class="font-serif text-2xl">
      <span class="text-ctp-subtext0 leading-relaxed">Alejandro Asensio</span>
      <br /><br />
      Frontend Engineer who deeply cares about user experience.
    </h1>
    <p>
      I'm currently building the revamped customer experience platform for
      hospitality businesses at <a
        href="https://www.trustyou.com/"
        class="hover:text-ctp-peach transition"
      >
        TrustYou
      </a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      To grab an idea of my previous work, check out my <a
        href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/aasensios/"
        class="hover:text-ctp-blue transition"
      >
        LinkedIn
      </a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      To see some other smaller side projects I built or contributed to, visit
      my <a
        href="https://github.com/aasensios"
        class="hover:text-ctp-green transition"
      >
        GitHub
      </a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      Disclaimer: Most of my contributions have been in companies that have
      closed-source projects in on-premises BitBucket instances, so my GitHub
      profile is not a reflection of my professional contributions.
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>
